  "question": {
    "text": "An <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;particle and a carbon <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> atom has same kinetic energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math>. The ratio of their de-Broglie wavelengths <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>De-Broglie wavelength is stated as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>K</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math>&nbsp;is kinetic energy and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;is mass.</p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mi>K</mi></mfenced><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mi>K</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8208;</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub></math>.</p><p>Now, the ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><msub><mi>&#955;</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msqrt><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
